## Anti-Patterns

**Wrong** — Exposing ports publicly:
```yaml
ports: ["0.0.0.0:8015:8015"]  # NEVER — bypasses UFW
```

**Right** — Tailscale-only binding:
```yaml
ports: ["${TAILSCALE_IP:-127.0.0.1}:8015:8015"]
```

**Wrong** — Rebuilding with `--no-cache`:
```bash
docker compose build --no-cache  # Wastes time, re-downloads everything
```

**Right** — Normal build (layer cache handles it):
```bash
docker compose build  # Only rebuilds changed layers
```

**Wrong** — Trying to delete volumes without backup:
```bash
docker volume rm deploy_pg_data  # PERMANENT — no undo
```

**Right** — Backup first, then explicit removal if needed:
```bash
ssh council-hub "/opt/council_mcp/deploy/scripts/backup-postgres.sh"
docker volume rm deploy_pg_data  # Only after verified backup
```
